          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tenetii entito natisiraki nenang'are olee ninye tiatua enkanasa neyiolou ninye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyau ninche pokira aipang'unye auluo ina anasa, ninang ninche too soito o metuata, ina kitok tenkaraki neitu eishir metomituni hoo netii atua enkanasa, o ilo lee enkaraki nainyala enkitok olelatia enye; neaku iwuang'ie entorroni tiatua intae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake teneinepu olee enkitok natasayiaki tiong'ata nemir ilo lee ninye neyiolou, naa ilo lee ake otayiolo oye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore ina kitok meitaasi ae; ore tialo ina kitok metii entorroni nairirikino keeya, amu ore ena kiguana nenyaanyukie enoltung'ani orasaki nesesekuan ilo lelatia enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkaraki nainepua ninye ti ong'ota, naa ore hoo neishira ina kitok nasayia metomituni metii oltung'ani omitu ninye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
