              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore ilo lee otayiolo ninye neisho menye ina tito shekeli onom e nkosholai, neyam ninye, enkaraki nainyala ninye; meidim ninye ataarai ninye too nkolong'i pooki enkishui enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.29",
